WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.540
Muslims live in many nations,
speak many languages,

2
00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:05.670
and come from many cultures.

3
00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:09.460
They live under different governments,
and there is no single leader over them

4
00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:10.380
all.

5
00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:14.330
Yet they call themselves
one community: the ummah.

6
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.640
So what holds so many
people, in so many cultures,

7
00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:19.940
together as one community?

8
00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:22.400
In this mission, you'll
go back to Madinah,

9
00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.610
where the first ummah was formed.

10
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:28.650
Then you'll compare how the two main
traditions of Islam understand the way it

11
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:29.880
is guided.

12
00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:33.280
Your mission: find out what
holds the ummah together,

13
00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:35.550
and how strong that bond is today.
